시 뒤, 멜리사가 흐느끼며 정신을 차렸다.","source_cn":"照看后，梅丽莎终于呜咽着醒来","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x596E1F2178BC7979","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1120405010:0":{"text":"갈리… 이건 갈리의 필체가 맞아요… 매번 탐사 보고서를 작성하면 저한테 보여줬거든요…","source_cn":"伽利……这是伽利的字迹……他每次写完勘探报告都会给我看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF220F0DB54454D0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1120405011:0":{"text":"갈리, 왜…? 흑흑흑…!","source_cn":"伽利，为什么……！呜呜呜呜……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78F4938B8A8AE22F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1120405012:0":{"text":"멜리사…","source_cn":"梅丽莎……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577D4C0E822EE553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:18:1120405012":{"text":"멜리사…","source_cn":"梅丽莎……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x577D4C0E822EE553","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1120405013:0":{"text":"…괜찮아요. 이렇게 울고만 있을 순 없어요...","source_cn":"……我，没事……我不能只流眼泪……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xABE41FF459F66BAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1120405014:0":{"text":"갈리가 이 세상에 남긴 마지막 편지를 편지에 적힌 사람에게 전달해야겠어요. 흑… 제가 할 수 있는 거라곤 이것밖에 없네요.","source_cn":"这是伽利最后留在这世上的东西，我得把信交给需要它的人，...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6B3833E21B097701","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1120405015:0":{"text":"유서에 보면 갈리는 어머니의 말씀에 따라 모두와 함께 세일린워터 마을에 머물고 싶다고 했어요…","source_cn":"信上说，伽利希望能听母亲的话，和大家一起待在咸水镇……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x14D621B3B77A0C51","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1120405016:0":{"text":"…갈리의 어머니요? 근데 갈리의 어머니는 오래전에 돌아가셨다고 들었는데…","source_cn":"……母亲？但、但伽利和我说过，他的母亲早就过世了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2BA001B5E3FAFB9A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1120405017:0":{"text":"하지만 유서에는 분명히 세일린워터 마을에 계신 어머니께 이 편지를 전해달라고 적혀있는데…","source_cn":"可信上确实是这么写的：“希望能将这封信交给我的母亲，她...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E196C0B13536D81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1120405018:0":{"text":"항상 의기양양하던 갈리는 어머니가 돌아가실 적 얘기만 꺼내면 항상 우울해 있었죠. 이건 제가 확실히 기억해요. ","source_cn":"伽利说起母亲过世时，情绪非常低沉，你们知道他平时神采飞...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3487345D6FF15972","varia